{"id":1498,"date":"2025-07-16T08:33:42","date_gmt":"2025-07-16T08:33:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/?p=1498"},"modified":"2025-07-16T16:19:19","modified_gmt":"2025-07-16T16:19:19","slug":"interactive-whiteboards-in-schools","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/interactive-whiteboards-in-schools\/","title":{"rendered":"Interactive Whiteboards in Schools: Irish Classrooms Are Making the Switch"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1498\" class=\"elementor elementor-1498\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d651270 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d651270\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-788c07b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"788c07b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Irish schools are changing \u2014 and so are their classrooms. With digital transformation at the heart of modern education, more and more schools across Ireland are replacing old tools like chalkboards and projectors with a smarter solution: the <\/span><b>interactive whiteboard<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Today\u2019s interactive whiteboards are <\/span><b>large-format touchscreen displays<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, designed for <\/span><b>collaborative learning<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, real-time annotation, and wireless sharing. They\u2019re helping schools boost engagement, streamline teaching, and prepare students for a tech-driven world.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Let\u2019s explore why interactive touchscreens \u2014 commonly known as interactive whiteboards \u2014 are becoming the standard in Irish primary and secondary schools.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43268c0 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"43268c0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7be0ee3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7be0ee3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Is an interactive whiteboard?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-77f2e5c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"77f2e5c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An <\/span><b>interactive whiteboard<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a digital display (usually 65\u201386 inches) that works like a giant tablet. It allows teachers and students to:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Write, draw, and annotate on-screen<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open and interact with educational apps<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Display and control lessons from a laptop, USB, or the cloud<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use built-in tools like timers, graphing, and split-screen<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enable student interaction at the board<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unlike traditional projectors, these screens offer:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No shadows<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No bulbs<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ultra-clear 4K resolution<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">True multi-touch support<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All-in-one, plug-and-play simplicity<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At <\/span><b>Interactive Displays Ireland<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we supply interactive whiteboards with advanced features and long warranties, purpose-built for Irish classrooms.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a20be56 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a20be56\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cdb61e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3cdb61e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Irish Schools Are Making the Switch\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ddd43e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ddd43e8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>1. Better Engagement = Better Learning<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Students learn best when they\u2019re engaged. The interactive whiteboard transforms passive lessons into <\/span><b>interactive experiences<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Students can come up and answer questions by touch<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teachers can use real-time drawing, video, and apps<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lessons become visual, dynamic, and more memorable<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udcca <\/span><b>Stat<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: According to a UK study, classrooms using interactive displays saw <\/span><b>a 16% improvement in student performance<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> compared to traditional whiteboards.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>2. Modern Tools for Modern Learners<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Today\u2019s students grow up using smartphones and tablets \u2014 they expect the same interactivity in the classroom. Interactive whiteboards bridge that gap:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Compatible with Google Classroom, Microsoft Teams, and Seesaw<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enable wireless screen sharing from iPads, Chromebooks, or laptops<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Support educational apps like Kahoot!, GeoGebra, and Scratch<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teachers can integrate video, websites, and cloud tools into any lesson \u2014 from maths to Gaeilge.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>3. More Teaching, Less Tech Trouble<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unlike old projector setups, interactive whiteboards don\u2019t need calibration, bulb replacements, or speakers. Most are all-in-one units with:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Built-in Android OS or Windows PC<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Touch-enabled whiteboarding apps<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">HDMI, USB, and wireless connectivity<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This saves teachers time and reduces IT headaches.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-051dac6 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"051dac6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44ac015 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"44ac015\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Real Feedback From Irish Classrooms<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fad209 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0fad209\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what some of our clients had to say after upgrading to <\/span><b>interactive whiteboards<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83c\udfeb <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cWe replaced our old Promethean board with a 75\u201d interactive touchscreen from Interactive Displays. The image quality is stunning and our teachers love how simple it is to use. No more delays at the start of class.\u201d<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 <\/span><b>Principal, Primary School in Meath<\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udcda <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cOur students are more involved in lessons and the ability to wirelessly cast from their Chromebooks has changed the way we teach group work.\u201d<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 <\/span><b>Secondary Teacher, Dublin<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42f44d9 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"42f44d9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-829afe8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"829afe8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How It Helps Teachers\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c4f373 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c4f373\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>No downtime<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Instant-on, no warm-up<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Built-in tools<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Rulers, protractors, split-screen, timers<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Record lessons<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Save and share content after class<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Collaboration<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Up to 20 students can interact at once<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many teachers even use the interactive whiteboard to run quizzes, play educational games, or bring in YouTube videos for visual learning.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5d39a0 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d5d39a0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-338ef4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"338ef4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Funding Support for Schools\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73e03b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"73e03b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Irish Department of Education continues to support digital infrastructure in schools through grant schemes and digital strategy rollouts. Interactive whiteboards fall under approved IT and AV equipment categories.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Need help with quotes or specs for tenders? <\/span><b>Interactive Displays Ireland<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> provides full support, including:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">WEEE-certified removal of old screens<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional installation nationwide<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CPD teacher training available<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">School-specific pricing with warranty<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68fae52 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"68fae52\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-74e03d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"74e03d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Choose Interactive Displays Ireland?\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0bf2242 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0bf2242\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019ve supplied and installed <\/span><b>interactive whiteboards<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for schools across Ireland since 2009 \u2014 from small rural classrooms to large secondary campuses.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what sets us apart:<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><b>Trusted brands<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> like Vestel, Moytronix, and CleverTouch<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><b>Tailored quotes<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for individual schools or full upgrades<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><b>On-site demos<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and remote training available<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><b>Content control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> via our optional platform,<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/screenfusion.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">screenfusion.ai<\/span><\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weigh